<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Kartoules - Error</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: #0d0d14;
      color: #c9d1d9;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .container {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 24px;
      max-width: 480px;
    }

    .status-code {
      font-size: 72px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #21262d;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #f0f6fc;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #8b949e;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .msg {
      background: #161b22;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', Menlo, monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #ff7b72;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      text-align: left;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    a {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #21262d;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: #c9d1d9;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }

    a:hover { background: #30363d; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="status-code">!</div>
    <h1>Something went wrong</h1>
    <p>The server encountered an error processing your request.</p>

    <div class="msg"><%= msg %></div>

    <a href="/gallery">&larr; Back to collection</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
